    "hinglishHtml": "<div class=\"callout\">\n    \ud83d\udccc <b>Course:</b> Docker & Kubernetes (KR Network Cloud)<br/>\n    \ud83c\udfaf <b>Objective:</b> Raw hard disk partition ko direct Docker Volume banana, Network Storage (NFS/CIFS) ko container se link karna, aur Docker ka Root Directory (/var/lib/docker) change karke production disk exhaustion se bachna.\n  </div>\n  <h3>1. Direct Disk Partition Volume</h3>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">mkfs -t xfs /dev/sdb\ndocker volume create --driver local --opt type=xfs --opt device=/dev/sdb --name mysqvol\ndocker run -d -v mysqvol:/var/lib/mysql --name=db -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=redhat mysql:5.6</code></pre>\n  <h3>2. Docker Root Directory (/data-root) Migration</h3>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">sudo systemctl stop docker\nsudo rsync -aP /var/lib/docker/ /data/docker/\n# Add \"data-root\": \"/data/docker\" to /etc/docker/daemon.json\nsudo systemctl start docker</code></pre>",
    "arabicHtml": "<div class=\"callout arabic\">\n    \ud83d\udccc <b>\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0629:</b> \u062f\u0648\u0643\u0631 \u0648\u0643\u0648\u0628\u0631\u0646\u064a\u062a\u0633 (KR Network Cloud)<br/>\n    \ud83c\udfaf <b>\u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u0641:</b> \u0625\u0646\u0634\u0627\u0621 \u0623\u062d\u062c\u0627\u0645 \u062f\u0648\u0643\u0631 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0637\u0629 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0634\u0631\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0642\u0631\u0627\u0635 \u0627\u0644\u0635\u0644\u0628\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0631\u0628\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062e\u0632\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0628\u0643\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u062a\u0631\u0643 (NFS/CIFS)\u060c \u0648\u062a\u063a\u064a\u064a\u0631 \u0645\u0633\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062e\u0632\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0630\u0631\u064a \u0644\u062f\u0648\u0643\u0631.\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"arabic\">\n    <h3>1. \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062e\u0632\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0628\u0643\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u062a\u0631\u0643 (NFS)</h3>\n    <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">docker volume create --opt type=nfs --opt o=addr=192.168.139.129 --opt device=:/scratch nfsvol\ndocker run -d --name=web -v nfsvol:/var/www/html nginx</code></pre>\n  </div>"
