    "hinglishHtml": "<div class=\"callout\">\n    \ud83d\udccc <b>Course:</b> Docker & Kubernetes (KR Network Cloud)<br/>\n    \ud83c\udfaf <b>Objective:</b> Docker Networking ka pura structure samajhna: docker0 default bridge, custom bridge networks, container DNS resolution, aur static (-p) vs dynamic (-P) port forwarding.\n  </div>\n  <h3>1. Default Bridge vs Custom Bridge</h3>\n  <p>Default docker0 bridge me container name se ping nahi hota. Custom bridge me Docker embedded DNS deta hai jisse container name se communication possible hota hai.</p>\n  <h3>2. Port Forwarding (-p vs -P)</h3>\n  <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">docker run -d --name=myweb -p 8080:80 nginx\ndocker run -d --name=myweb2 -P nginx</code></pre>",
