    "hinglishHtml": "<div class=\"callout\">\n    \ud83d\udccc <b>Course:</b> Docker & Kubernetes (KR Network Cloud)<br/>\n    \ud83c\udfaf <b>Objective:</b> Docker ke advanced networking drivers (Host, None, Macvlan, IPvlan) ko samajhna, 2-Tier WordPress+MySQL deployment karna, aur physical network level par containers ko IP dena.\n  </div>\n  <h3>1. Host vs None Network</h3>\n  <p><b>Host:</b> Direct host ke network se judta hai, koi port forwarding nahi chahiye.<br/>\n  <b>None:</b> Poora isolated hota hai (no internet, only 127.0.0.1).</p>\n  <h3>2. Macvlan vs IPvlan</h3>\n  <p><b>Macvlan:</b> Har container ko naya MAC aur IP milta hai.<br/>\n  <b>IPvlan:</b> Container naya IP leta hai par host ka MAC address share karta hai.</p>",
    "arabicHtml": "<div class=\"callout arabic\">\n    \ud83d\udccc <b>\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u0629:</b> \u062f\u0648\u0643\u0631 \u0648\u0643\u0648\u0628\u0631\u0646\u064a\u062a\u0633 (KR Network Cloud)<br/>\n    \ud83c\udfaf <b>\u0627\u0644\u0647\u062f\u0641:</b> \u0625\u062a\u0642\u0627\u0646 \u0645\u062d\u0631\u0643\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0628\u0643\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u0642\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u062f\u0648\u0643\u0631 (Host, None, Macvlan, IPvlan)\u060c \u0648\u0646\u0634\u0631 \u062a\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0642\u0627\u062a \u0645\u062a\u0639\u062f\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0628\u0642\u0627\u062a.\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"arabic\">\n    <h3>1. \u0634\u0628\u0643\u0627\u062a \u062f\u0648\u0643\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u0642\u062f\u0645\u0629</h3>\n    <pre><code class=\"language-bash\">docker run -d --name=web1 --network host nginx\ndocker network create -d macvlan --subnet=192.168.1.0/24 --gateway=192.168.1.1 -o parent=eth0 corp-macvlan</code></pre>\n  </div>"
